- **Protect against prolonged outages:** A circuit breaker can pause calls to an unhealthy service and periodically check whether it has recovered.
- **Log and monitor:** Record the endpoint, status, duration, retry count, and a correlation ID—without logging secrets or sensitive payloads. Alert on rising error rates or latency.
- **Keep user-facing messages helpful:** Avoid exposing internal details; offer a retry option when appropriate.

